[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6783.03, "timestamp": "01:53:03", "text": "喬克。你什麼時候會做一個騎著像雞一樣的動物的模型？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6793.109, "timestamp": "01:53:13", "text": "我的天哪，我們需要這位騎師。就在那裡。梗圖就在那裡。雞騎師。我的天啊。就在那裡。梗圖就在那裡。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6812.346, "timestamp": "01:53:32", "author": "@BreaDGuy0078", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/O8v1G-sabQKoVvPbSD8h_pLVydQ_mLyNSXpDD2A2gNJXBLHO228IzT5zq41iTuqUdmG_2xiIlg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Emma Frost?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6815.43, "timestamp": "01:53:35", "text": "它自己就會自動運行，老兄。麵包小哥真是酷了。  我正在努力。不用擔心。麵包師傅的廚藝。  我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6817.27, "timestamp": "01:53:37", "text": "天啊。該死。春李。這品味真不錯。是的，春麗其實是娜，但問題是，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6823.589, "timestamp": "01:53:43", "text": "我覺得春麗"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6825.79, "timestamp": "01:53:45", "text": "不是理想的妻子人選。  就像我在想浪漫的事，對吧？  我現在想的是浪漫意義上的浪漫"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6830.43, "timestamp": "01:53:50", "text": "，而不是性方面的，因為我覺得春麗太執著於保護某樣東西了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6833.43, "timestamp": "01:53:53", "text": "。我明白這一點，但我"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6833.592, "timestamp": "01:53:53", "author": "@BreaDGuy0078", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/O8v1G-sabQKoVvPbSD8h_pLVydQ_mLyNSXpDD2A2gNJXBLHO228IzT5zq41iTuqUdmG_2xiIlg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "u mean from X-men"}]